  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "31",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 31"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "31",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulet tagh Musa kïmwochï pipö Israel ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.20.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kiy 20:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lö, “Ketïta ye könyiswechan 120, nyo melö tomukan ye olïku kintöghoghintenkwa, amelö nyoni onkït, kataghenanïn ECHOTYON oghyö lalwa Yordan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntöghoghwokwa ECHOTYON Tororötïnkwa oghyenö antakwagh. Wongöy nyinte punton cho mi wölini atö achenga kore. Ntöghoghwokwa Yoswö oghyenö lalwa Yordan kïrïp kegh nko ngölyonto ECHOTYON. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.21.21+NUM.21.22+NUM.21.23+NUM.21.24+NUM.21.25+NUM.21.26+NUM.21.27+NUM.21.28+NUM.21.29+NUM.21.30+NUM.21.31+NUM.21.32+NUM.21.33+NUM.21.34+NUM.21.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kiy 21:21-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wongöy ECHOTYON puntonichoni le wölo kida Sion nko Ok pöytoghi pipö Amori nko korengwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konokwa ECHOTYON owesyö nyo orïntegho chane, parakunkwa nyu oghchinö chane lenyini komwowokwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okil kegh anyökonitu, momïghyö anta awagh chane ompöwölo ntöghoghwokwa ECHOTYON Tororötïnkwa, ngörokokwa nyinte nyo mötïny, amelö pïstonokwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay kïkur Musa Yoswö akïmwochï kïmi nko pipö Israel löwïr lö, “Ikil kegh ainyakanitï, ompöwölo nyi nyo intöghoghchini pïchï ntökwit koronini kiyomisyï ECHOTYON papotïnekwa lö otöni chane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.1.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 1:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.13.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Epr 13:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntöghoghwokwa ECHOTYON nyinte akïtöpö nko akwa. Ngörokokwa nyinte nyo mötïny amelö pïstonokwa, kïlenyona momïghyö anta awagh chane.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kisomönöy kirurut köny anka tïkwïl nyo pö mut nko odeny",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukir Musa kirurutyononi akutö tïsï cho le pipö Lawi cho kisïtöy Santuku Muma* ECHOTYON nko poyi Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kimwochï Musa chane lö, “Nyini ketïta sörömu köny anka tïkwïl nyo pö mut nko odeny, otini karich kwitïta asisay, kïpïstö pösönut ompö Ichon pö Tunkun, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "otini ketï pipö Israel löwïr atoni kakïl ECHOTYON kesagha nyinte, osomönchï chane löwïr kirurut kïlïm. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okur mïrön nko kor nko monïng nko pïnot cho omitekwa tïkwïl, atökumï chane kïlïm akunet kegh akïkonyït ECHOTYON Tororötïnkwa atökwigh chane ngalechoni löwïr pö kirurut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkïtu nyu monekwa cho kitomöcha kïlïm kirurut pö ECHOTYON Tororötïnkwa akunet kegh akïkonyït nyinte osis löwïr otini tökïmi chane koronini oghchinekwa ompö lalwa Yordan atachenga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ngala ECHOTYON cho pö söröm cho kimwochï Musa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay kïlenchï ECHOTYON Musa, “Karich rapasanyi, kurunö Yoswö aimïtï kïlïtï emanï atoporchan nyinte kïgh nyo ighöy.” Kïwö Musa nko Yoswö kutang Emanay pö Tuyot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kungwïnchï ECHOTYON chane ompö pchöri polta akughyongö kuka Emanay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï ECHOTYON Musa, “Karich wïyönyi rïwö nko kukötineku, otini melö temitenönyi, wöghökisyot pïchï akïsagh tororötine walaka cho mi koronini karich kïlït. Pïstonanïn chane akïpeny mumenyan nyo kyaman nko chane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onörekyinan chane tya asisoni apïstan awïnyan kegh chane atökewany. Nyoru chane nyörilwok cho pö otyogh, akutupï nyarïl kong, ato mi löt kïlö, ‘Ketwecha tïkuchï ghach löwïr, ompöwölo kakïpïstecha ECHOTYON.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owïngan kegh nyoman asisoni, akwompö ghöyityengwa nyo kigh chane, otini kiwöghökisyö akïsagh tororötine walaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kïlenyona nyu, akira tumï anet pipö Israel, atökïlïkwï nyoni kïgh nyo rwokyini chane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omïtan chane kïlïtöy koronay chang chö akïwow kumata, kïle wölanye kyoyomisön kukötinekwa. Atökïnyorï chane omisyö anka tïkwïl nyo kömököy, akïmöngisyö nyo karam. Wölo wöghökisyot chane akïsagh tororötin walaka. Töghanïn chane akïpeny mumenyan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akïnyorï nyörilwokï cho pö otyogh. Wölo kïrkegh kïlenyoni anet pipö Israel atökïlïkwï kïgh nyo rwokyini chane ompöwölo, melö wutyegho monekwa tumoni. Onkïtön kinonutkökwa cho nonöy, kïrkegh ompö nyete le ye kïtomö kwitïta chane koronini kyoyomisyan.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukir Musa tumoni asisoni akunet pipö Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
